```
Call in killEnemy after score addition, and in reboot after penalty? Best shouldn't decrease; best already recorded. Update best display live. Save each kill that sets a record → localStorage writes maybe frequent early; fine. Throttle optional: only when score beats best; at 60 fps kills maybe few/s. Acceptable.

syncBest updates best text. It currently sets text and finalBest. Simplify.

Reset: reboots.

Reboot implementation:
```
function reboot(){
  const p=G.player;
  G.reboots++;
  const penalty = Math.round(G.score*0.2);
  G.score = Math.max(0,G.score-penalty);
  G.combo=1; G.comboT=0;
  G.ebullets.length=0;
  for(let i=G.enemies.length-1;i>=0;i--){
    const e=G.enemies[i];
