Remove gameOver function and final stats.

Potential overlay after reboot: none. Good—continuous.

Also `startGame` from menu; no way to restart run while playing except reload or... Add "R restart" maybe not needed since endless. Could add restart option in pause overlay? Not required.

But user may want to reset run. Add pause screen "RESTART RUN" button? Minor; skip.

Also start screen copy and README update: game never ends.

Wave budget cap: `let budget = Math.min(78, Math.round(4 + wave*2.6));` and spawn interval floor 0.16 already; wave speed scaling capped; hp cap 13x. Also wave 4 guaranteed brute only once.

Also the "next wave" heal every 3rd wave.

