content.text:
Now JS. Add POWERUPS config and els.buffs.

At top after TYPES:
```
const POWERUPS = {
 aegis:{label:'AEGIS', color:'#ffd166'},
 triple:..., nova:..., od:...
};
```
Durations constants maybe in effects.

Add els.buffs.

G fields: invincible, triple, powerupT, buffKey? G.powerupT = 5.

reset these.

update: decrement timers, spawn.

Function randomPowerup:
```
function spawnRandomPowerup(){
 const types = ['aegis','triple','nova','od','aegis']; // weighted
 const type = types[(Math.random()*types.length)|0];
 // avoid too many on field
 const count = G.pickups.filter(q=>q.power).length;
 if(count>=3) return;
 let x,y, tries=0;
 do { x=rand(70,W-70); y=rand(130,H-70); tries++; } while (Math.hypot(x-G.player.x,y-G.player.y)<120 && tries<14);
 G.pickups.push({x,y,type,t:0,life:20,power:true});
 G.particles.push({x,y,vx:0,vy:0,r:18,life:0.6,maxLife:0.6,color:POWERUPS[type].color,ring:true});
 floatText(x, y-28, POWERUPS[type].label + ' DROP', POWERUPS[type].color);
}
```
Powerup colors: aegis gold, triple purple, nova orange, od pink. HP green.

Spawn timer only while playing. Also only after wave 1 start? Start at 4.5s, fine.

Update pickup collection:
```
const info = POWERUPS[q.type];
...
if (q.type==='hp') {...}
else if (q.type==='od'){G.overdrive=8;...}
else if (q.type==='aegis'){ G.invincible=Math.max(G.invincible,12); showBanner('AEGIS','YOU CANNOT DIE'); ...}
else if (q.type==='triple'){G.triple=Math.max(G.triple,12); showBanner('TRIPLE SHOT','3X FIREPOWER');...}
else if (q.type==='nova'){ detonateNova(); }
```
For nova, no persistent buff.

Effects sfx: pickup + tone; maybe add `sfx.power()`.

Firing triple:
```
const angles = G.triple>0 ? [-0.15,0,0.15] : [0];
for (const off of angles){ push bullet with a = p.angle+off+spread }
```
Damage maybe 12 each. Colors: triple → '#c99bff'; overdrive → pink; else cyan.
Muzzle burst once.

Fire rate: overdrive 0.075; else 0.155; triple maybe 0.14? Keep.

Invincible damage guard: `if (G.invincible > 0) return;` at start of damagePlayer after state check. Also while invincible, remove contact? The enemy still overlaps but no damage; fine. Could add contact push.

Draw player aura:
- if invincible: golden rotating dashed ring + aura; draw before ship:
```
ctx.save(); translate; rotate(t*1.5); strokeStyle gold; lineWidth 2; setLineDash([10,8]); arc(0,0,26); stroke; setLineDash([]); globalAlpha .1 fill arc 30; restore
```
- triple: purple small orbiting orbs? Optional. Draw three small dots orbiting at radius 20. Nice.

Draw pickups: rework color/shape. Current code:
```
const color = q.type==='hp'?green:pink
...
if hp plus else bolt
```
Replace color determination with map:
```
const color = q.type==='hp'?COLORS.green: (POWERUPS[q.type]?.color || COLORS.pink);
const R = q.power ? 16 : 14;
```
Draw circle radius R. Shapes:
- hp plus
- od bolt
- aegis shield: path rounded shield
- triple: 3 small circles/chevrons
- nova: 4-point star
Label for powerups: ctx.font 8px; fillText(label, 0, R+14) with globalAlpha. But text drawn in rotated/scaled? no rotation. Add after restore? Simpler inside translated context without rotation: fillText at y+... but ctx scaled pulse; okay. Keep label small.

Since pickups aren't rotated currently; add slight rotation for powerups? We can rotate for shapes but label then rotates. Draw shape rotation then restore to label. Structure:
```
ctx.save(); translate; scale(pulse);
... glow circle ...
ctx.save(); if power rotate(t*1.2) ; draw icon; ctx.restore();
if(power) label
ctx.restore();
```
Current icon is centered and not rotated. Implement.

HUD buffs:
`updateBuffs()`:
```
const buffs = [];
if (G.invincible>0) buffs.push(['AEGIS '+Math.ceil(G.invincible)+'s','#ffd166']);
if (G.triple>0) buffs.push(['TRIPLE '+Math.ceil(G.triple)+'s','#b06bff']);
if (G.overdrive>0) buffs.push(['OVERDRIVE '+Math.ceil(G.overdrive)+'s','#ff2fb0']);
const key = buffs.map(b=>b.join()).join('|');
if(key!==lastBuffKey){ lastBuffKey=key; els.buffs.innerHTML = buffs.map(...).join(''); }
```
Use `<span class="buff" style="color:${color}"><i></i>${label}</span>`.

Call in updateHud.

Emergency reboot modify:
- remove penalty lines and message; set G.invincible = Math.max(G.invincible, 6) and invuln; banner 'AEGIS SURGE' 'YOU CANNOT DIE'; sfx maybe.
- Keep clearing area.
- No score loss.

Start screen mentions can't die.

Best score unaffected.

Also user said "powerups that just appear random" — random timer and random location. Good.

Potential balance: random pickups spawn regardless of wave; 4 types. Aegis 12s may be frequent (~20-25% every 6-10s) → near-permanent invincibility. That's okay user wants can't die. Powerfulness. Could make aegis 10s, drop rate 20%.

Add pickup lifetime 22s; if not collected they disappear.

Also random spawner maybe spawn even during pause? update paused so no.

Implement now.

