content.text:
Now add spawnRandomPowerup and detonateNova functions. Place after spawnEnemy maybe. Find end of spawnEnemy.

Add:
```
function spawnRandomPowerup(){
  if (G.pickups.filter(q=>q.power).length >= 3) return;
  const bag = ['aegis','triple','nova','od','aegis','triple','nova','od','aegis']; // 3/9 aegis
...
}
```
Weight aegis 33% every ~8s → 12s duration, near permanent. Maybe weights: aegis 2, triple 3, nova 2, od 2 → 22% aegis. With duration 12s and spawn 8.5s average → around 30% uptime? Actually 22% chance per 8.5s means one aegis per ~38s, 12s uptime ~30%. Good.

Positions avoid player within 110 and avoid top HUD? y between 140 and H-70.

Spawn only after wave 1? powerupT initial 5; fine.

Visual: spawn ring + float label.

`detonateNova()`:
```
const p=G.player;
G.shake=34; G.flash=1;
for (let i=enemies.length-1;i>=0;i--){ const e=enemies[i]; e.hp-=400; e.hitT=0.1; burst(e.x,e.y,e.color,8,220); if(e.hp<=0) killEnemy(i); }
G.ebullets.length=0;
particles.push ring at player r=20 life .8 color '#ff7a45'
floatText(p.x,p.y-40,'NOVA SURGE','#ff7a45')
showBanner('NOVA','AREA CLEARED');
tone(120,900,0.5,'sawtooth',0.05); tone(900,80,0.5,'sine',0.04);
```
Note killEnemy may drop pickups — fun.

Aegis collection: G.invincible = max(..., 12); showBanner('AEGIS','YOU CANNOT DIE'); burst gold; sound power.
Triple: 12s; showBanner('TRIPLE SHOT','3X FIREPOWER').
Overdrive: 8s (existing was 6) showBanner('OVERDRIVE','RAPID FIRE').

Add `sfx.power()`: ascending arpeggio.

Add after spawnEnemy or before input. Let's insert after spawnEnemy function ends. Find line with `if (G.enemies.length > 60) G.enemies.shift();`.

input.newString:
  burst(x, y, base.color, 10, 150);
  G.particles.push({ x, y, vx: 0, vy: 0, r: 26, life: 0.4, maxLife: 0.4, color: base.color, ring: true });
  if (G.enemies.length > 60) G.enemies.shift();
}

function spawnRandomPowerup() {
  if (G.pickups.filter((q) => q.power).length >= 3) return;
  const bag = ['aegis', 'triple', 'nova', 'od', 'triple', 'nova', 'od', 'aegis', 'triple'];
  const type = bag[(Math.random() * bag.length) | 0];
  const p = G.player;
  let x = W / 2;
  let y = H / 2;
  for (let i = 0; i < 16; i++) {
    x = rand(64, W - 64);
    y = rand(140, H - 64);
    if (Math.hypot(x - p.x, y - p.y) > 120) break;
  }
  G.pickups.push({ x, y, type, t: 0, life: 20, power: true });
  const info = POWERUPS[type];
  G.particles.push({ x, y, vx: 0, vy: 0, r: 18, life: 0.65, maxLife: 0.65, color: info.color, ring: true });
  G.particles.push({ x, y, vx: 0, vy: 0, r: 4, life: 0.65, maxLife: 0.65, color: info.color, ring: true });
  floatText(x, y - 30, info.label + ' DROP', info.color);
  tone(520, 780, 0.18, 'sine', 0.02);
}

function detonateNova() {
  const p = G.player;
  G.shake = 34;
  G.flash = 1.1;
  for (let i = G.enemies.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
    const e = G.enemies[i];
    e.hp -= 400;
    e.hitT = 0.12;
    burst(e.x, e.y, e.color, 7, 220);
    if (e.hp <= 0) killEnemy(i);
  }
  G.ebullets.length = 0;
  G.particles.push({ x: p.x, y: p.y, vx: 0, vy: 0, r: 24, life: 0.8, maxLife: 0.8, color: '#ff7a45', ring: true });
  G.particles.push({ x: p.x, y: p.y, vx: 0, vy: 0, r: 10, life: 0.8, maxLife: 0.8, color: '#ffd166', ring: true });
  floatText(p.x, p.y - 40, 'NOVA SURGE', '#ff7a45');
  showBanner('NOVA', 'AREA CLEARED');
  tone(120, 920, 0.45, 'sawtooth', 0.05);
  tone(920, 90, 0.55, 'sine', 0.04);
}

