```
But if G.state playing and openUpgrade sets state 'upgrade'. The remainder of update (updateHud) still runs. Fine.

openUpgrade:
```
function openUpgrade(){
 if(G.state!=='playing') return;
 G.state='upgrade';
 const pool=UPGRADES.filter(u=>(G.up.stacks[u.id]||0)<u.max);
 // shuffle
