 G.shake=Math.max(G.shake,6);
 burst(G.player.x,G.player.y,u.color,18,220);
 floatText(G.player.x, G.player.y-34, u.name, u.color);
 sfx.pickup(); tone(660,1320,0.2,'sine',0.04);
 updateHud(true);
 if(G.pendingUpgrades>0) openUpgrade();
 else {
  G.state='playing';
  hideOverlay();
  last=performance.now();
 }
}
```
When openUpgrade called while state 'upgrade', guard allows.

